{"about_the_game":"&quot;She's Lost Control!&quot;<br><br>A barrage of missiles emerges from the clouds; it\u2019s cloudphobia!<br><br>In this pulse-pounding arcade style shoot 'em up, players control giant armored robots, loaded with hi-tech weaponry. Choose from two types of weapons: the PLG-90, a high-tech laser rifle or the Vibroblade N\u00fallPunktur! Comprised of five 3-minute episodes, players must protect the mothership while slashing, shooting and boosting their way to the end of each level and defeat the boss within the time limit.<br><br>cloudphobia mixes arcade style gameplay, anime and creative robot designs, with lush backdrops that melt into the bots-and-battleship action. Get ready for a visually stunning shoot 'em up experience! <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A beautiful horizontally-scrolling shoot 'em-up<br></li><li>Two different play styles: Pilot the sword-swinging &quot;N\u00fallpunktur,&quot; or the laser wielding mobile suit, &quot;PLG-90&quot;<br></li><li>Save your replays<br></li><li>Global Internet Ranking<br></li><li>Steam Achievements and Leaderboards</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Untouchable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/329340/f516adb84e7709ce3cf3d72531bb910b57594503.jpg"},{"name":"Just in time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/329340/55a0972b42b992d47dd008374efa869d016d483a.jpg"},{"name":"Mothership Defender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/329340/f25ee00a95504dbf7d8845a5993fd8f85c328d96.jpg"},{"name":"The Sword is mightier than the gun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/329340/99daf6590462187fc985431568603732b4f39644.jpg"},{"name":"1 Coin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/329340/69ee3d280c343894f6c0928b30d97c6f794aa3b0.jpg"},{"name":"I'm 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco